 under the supervision of the State Bank Commissioner or the Credit Union Administrator. (Code 1981 § 38-50. Code 1995 § 114-86.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"f27fe8a6-4b97-5912-a7b9-e54f131bc32c"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.110.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.110.010","content_hash":"06e14d0ebd52300a4940f01134a36eb0aa2b67f39a58c4b905cd742a8e257e8f","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.110.010","text":"Cross References: Definitions generally, TMC 1.10.020 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"23424450-7974-5285-b4f0-355a686b917f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.110.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.110.010","content_hash":"9ffa444e118611aea9bdb86be2bbaed01df99ca2d1589fd1812091bd197e7948","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.110.010","text":"State Law References: Pawnbroker defined, K.S.A. 16-706 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b72b9ed5-7b2c-53eb-a0b0-8888349b4c9c"},{"attributes":{"legacy_definition_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.110.010:def:established-place-of-business"},"citation":"5.110.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.110.010","content_hash":"fa40c551d73a1dcc56a3b635c62bcac64febd967c7b86bf4e7d6065df71879a0","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.110.010:definiti